[{"id":"andhara-18-2-1","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"pa sam vas opomenuo","en":"so I warned you"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"opomenuo je","en":"he/it warned"}],"ref":"18:2","answerWord":"لِّيُنذِرَ","answerSound":"audio/92ca2b444ce3202dfb5b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(But hath made it) straight, to give warning of stern punishment from Him, and to bring unto the believers who do good works the news that theirs will be a fair reward,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["قَيِّمًا","لِّيُنذِرَ","بَأْسًا","شَدِيدًا","مِّن","لَّدُنْهُ","وَيُبَشِّرَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَعْمَلُونَ","ٱلصَّٰلِحَٰتِ","أَنَّ","لَهُمْ","أَجْرًا","حَسَنًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-26-214-0","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i opomeni!","en":"and warn!"},{"bs":"da vas opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i da bivaju opomenuti","en":"and so that they may be warned"}],"ref":"26:214","answerWord":"وَأَنذِرْ","answerSound":"audio/e956aa7adcc0204e19d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn thy tribe of near kindred,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرْ","عَشِيرَتَكَ","ٱلْأَقْرَبِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-6-130-10","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"opomenuo sam vas","en":"I warned you (all)"},{"bs":"i da opomenu","en":"and so that they may warn"}],"ref":"6:130","answerWord":"وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/82a3351ddac0c971bdc6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye assembly of the jinn and humankind! Came there not unto you messengers of your own who recounted unto you My tokens and warned you of the meeting of this your Day? They will say: We testify against ourselves. And the life of the world beguiled them. And they testify against themselves that they were disbelievers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["يَٰمَعْشَرَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","وَٱلْإِنسِ","أَلَمْ","يَأْتِكُمْ","رُسُلٌ","مِّنكُمْ","يَقُصُّونَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","ءَايَٰتِى","وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ","لِقَآءَ","يَوْمِكُمْ","هَٰذَا","قَالُوا۟","شَهِدْنَا","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِنَا","وَغَرَّتْهُمُ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَشَهِدُوا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","أَنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","كَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-7-63-9","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"da vas opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni!","en":"and warn!"},{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"opomenite!","en":"(you all) warn!"}],"ref":"7:63","answerWord":"لِيُنذِرَكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e371b31add7a8cbdc839.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Marvel ye that there should come unto you a Reminder from your Lord by means of a man among you, that he may warn you, and that ye may keep from evil, and that haply ye may find mercy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ","أَن","جَآءَكُمْ","ذِكْرٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","عَلَىٰ","رَجُلٍ","مِّنكُمْ","لِيُنذِرَكُمْ","وَلِتَتَّقُوا۟","وَلَعَلَّكُمْ","تُرْحَمُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-18-56-16","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenuti su","en":"they were warned"},{"bs":"opomenuo sam vas","en":"I warned you (all)"},{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"},{"bs":"opomeni!","en":"warn!"}],"ref":"18:56","answerWord":"أُنذِرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/fd0f7bcd45b3c15afa0f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We send not the messengers save as bearers of good news and warners. Those who disbelieve contend with falsehood in order to refute the Truth thereby. And they take Our revelations and that wherewith they are threatened as a jest.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَمَا","نُرْسِلُ","ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","إِلَّا","مُبَشِّرِينَ","وَمُنذِرِينَ","وَيُجَٰدِلُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","بِٱلْبَٰطِلِ","لِيُدْحِضُوا۟","بِهِ","ٱلْحَقَّ","وَٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","ءَايَٰتِى","وَمَآ","أُنذِرُوا۟","هُزُوًا"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-19-39-0","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"opomenuo sam vas","en":"I warned you (all)"},{"bs":"da vas opomenem","en":"so that I may warn you (all)"},{"bs":"da vas opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn you (all)"}],"ref":"19:39","answerWord":"وَأَنذِرْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e2faccb3577acdebddf1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn them of the Day of anguish when the case hath been decided. Now they are in a state of carelessness, and they believe not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرْهُمْ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْحَسْرَةِ","إِذْ","قُضِىَ","ٱلْأَمْرُ","وَهُمْ","فِى","غَفْلَةٍ","وَهُمْ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-9-122-15","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i da opomenu","en":"and so that they may warn"},{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"}],"ref":"9:122","answerWord":"وَلِيُنذِرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/7405a5e5f8e7a0c590ee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the believers should not all go out to fight. Of every troop of them, a party only should go forth, that they (who are left behind) may gain sound knowledge in religion, and that they may warn their folk when they return to them, so that they may beware.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَمَا","كَانَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","لِيَنفِرُوا۟","كَآفَّةً","فَلَوْلَا","نَفَرَ","مِن","كُلِّ","فِرْقَةٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","طَآئِفَةٌ","لِّيَتَفَقَّهُوا۟","فِى","ٱلدِّينِ","وَلِيُنذِرُوا۟","قَوْمَهُمْ","إِذَا","رَجَعُوٓا۟","إِلَيْهِمْ","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَحْذَرُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-10-2-9","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomeni!","en":"warn!"},{"bs":"i da opomene","en":"and to warn"},{"bs":"opomenut je","en":"he/it was warned"},{"bs":"da vas opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn you (all)"}],"ref":"10:2","answerWord":"أَنذِرِ","answerSound":"audio/b04ac8ecac96dac8e180.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is it a wonder for mankind that We have inspired a man among them, saying: Warn mankind and bring unto those who believe the good tidings that they have a sure footing with their Lord? The disbelievers say: Lo! this is a mere wizard.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["أَكَانَ","لِلنَّاسِ","عَجَبًا","أَنْ","أَوْحَيْنَآ","إِلَىٰ","رَجُلٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","أَنْ","أَنذِرِ","ٱلنَّاسَ","وَبَشِّرِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","أَنَّ","لَهُمْ","قَدَمَ","صِدْقٍ","عِندَ","رَبِّهِمْ","قَالَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرُونَ","إِنَّ","هَٰذَا","لَسَٰحِرٌ","مُّبِينٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-14-44-0","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i opomeni!","en":"and warn!"},{"bs":"bivaju opomenuti","en":"they are warned"},{"bs":"opomenut je","en":"he/it was warned"},{"bs":"opomenuo ih je","en":"he/it warned them"}],"ref":"14:44","answerWord":"وَأَنذِرِ","answerSound":"audio/588bf02b933938e9fac6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn mankind of a day when the doom will come upon them, and those who did wrong will say: Our Lord! Reprieve us for a little while. We will obey Thy call and will follow the messengers. (It will be answered): Did ye not swear before that there would be no end for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرِ","ٱلنَّاسَ","يَوْمَ","يَأْتِيهِمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","فَيَقُولُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَخِّرْنَآ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","قَرِيبٍ","نُّجِبْ","دَعْوَتَكَ","وَنَتَّبِعِ","ٱلرُّسُلَ","أَوَلَمْ","تَكُونُوٓا۟","أَقْسَمْتُم","مِّن","قَبْلُ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّن","زَوَالٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-14-52-3","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i da bivaju opomenuti","en":"and so that they may be warned"},{"bs":"da vas opomenem","en":"so that I may warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni!","en":"and warn!"},{"bs":"i da opomene","en":"and to warn"}],"ref":"14:52","answerWord":"وَلِيُنذَرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/7b9d611f21783f3fa186.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"This is a clear message for mankind in order that they may be warned thereby, and that they may know that He is only One Allah, and that men of understanding may take heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["هَٰذَا","بَلَٰغٌ","لِّلنَّاسِ","وَلِيُنذَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","وَلِيَعْلَمُوٓا۟","أَنَّمَا","هُوَ","إِلَٰهٌ","وَٰحِدٌ","وَلِيَذَّكَّرَ","أُو۟لُوا۟","ٱلْأَلْبَٰبِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-16-2-11","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenite!","en":"(you all) warn!"},{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"i opomeni!","en":"and warn!"},{"bs":"opomenuo ih je","en":"he/it warned them"}],"ref":"16:2","answerWord":"أَنذِرُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/3b8f3ded0b56d6011b45.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He sendeth down the angels with the Spirit of His command unto whom He will of His bondmen, (saying): Warn mankind that there is no Allah save Me, so keep your duty unto Me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["يُنَزِّلُ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةَ","بِٱلرُّوحِ","مِنْ","أَمْرِهِۦ","عَلَىٰ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦٓ","أَنْ","أَنذِرُوٓا۟","أَنَّهُۥ","لَآ","إِلَٰهَ","إِلَّآ","أَنَا۠","فَٱتَّقُونِ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-18-4-0","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"i da opomene","en":"and to warn"},{"bs":"opomenuo je","en":"he/it warned"},{"bs":"opomenut je","en":"he/it was warned"},{"bs":"pa opomeni!","en":"so warn!"}],"ref":"18:4","answerWord":"وَيُنذِرَ","answerSound":"audio/1497596eefc3659a70aa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And to warn those who say: Allah hath chosen a son,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَيُنذِرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَالُوا۟","ٱتَّخَذَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَلَدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-21-45-2","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I warn you (all)"},{"bs":"i da opomenu","en":"and so that they may warn"},{"bs":"opomenuli smo vas","en":"we warned you (all)"},{"bs":"opomeni!","en":"warn!"}],"ref":"21:45","answerWord":"أُنذِرُكُم","answerSound":"audio/e2999b6331c4eb09e324.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (O Muhammad, unto mankind): I warn you only by the Inspiration. But the deaf hear not the call when they are warned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّمَآ","أُنذِرُكُم","بِٱلْوَحْىِ","وَلَا","يَسْمَعُ","ٱلصُّمُّ","ٱلدُّعَآءَ","إِذَا","مَا","يُنذَرُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-21-45-10","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"bivaju opomenuti","en":"they are warned"},{"bs":"i da opomene","en":"and to warn"},{"bs":"opomenut je","en":"he/it was warned"},{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I warn you (all)"}],"ref":"21:45","answerWord":"يُنذَرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/38a3646f638544c4e30e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (O Muhammad, unto mankind): I warn you only by the Inspiration. But the deaf hear not the call when they are warned.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّمَآ","أُنذِرُكُم","بِٱلْوَحْىِ","وَلَا","يَسْمَعُ","ٱلصُّمُّ","ٱلدُّعَآءَ","إِذَا","مَا","يُنذَرُونَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-36-6-3","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenut je","en":"he/it was warned"},{"bs":"i da bivaju opomenuti","en":"and so that they may be warned"},{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"}],"ref":"36:6","answerWord":"أُنذِرَ","answerSound":"audio/a82d82b3bfef10a8a568.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That thou mayst warn a folk whose fathers were not warned, so they are heedless.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["لِتُنذِرَ","قَوْمًا","مَّآ","أُنذِرَ","ءَابَآؤُهُمْ","فَهُمْ","غَٰفِلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-40-15-13","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"da opomene","en":"so that he/it may warn"},{"bs":"pa opomeni!","en":"so warn!"},{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I warn you (all)"},{"bs":"opomenuli smo vas","en":"we warned you (all)"}],"ref":"40:15","answerWord":"لِيُنذِرَ","answerSound":"audio/537d040a03d4a93b4b6b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The Exalter of Ranks, the Lord of the Throne. He causeth the Spirit of His command upon whom He will of His slaves, that He may warn of the Day of Meeting,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["رَفِيعُ","ٱلدَّرَجَٰتِ","ذُو","ٱلْعَرْشِ","يُلْقِى","ٱلرُّوحَ","مِنْ","أَمْرِهِۦ","عَلَىٰ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","مِنْ","عِبَادِهِۦ","لِيُنذِرَ","يَوْمَ","ٱلتَّلَاقِ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-41-13-3","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenuo sam vas","en":"I warned you (all)"},{"bs":"pa opomeni!","en":"so warn!"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"i da bivaju opomenuti","en":"and so that they may be warned"}],"ref":"41:13","answerWord":"أَنذَرْتُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/e54c150f399e09a8a7ba.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But if they turn away, then say: I warn you of a thunderbolt like the thunderbolt (which fell of old upon the tribes) of A'ad and Thamud;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["فَإِنْ","أَعْرَضُوا۟","فَقُلْ","أَنذَرْتُكُمْ","صَٰعِقَةً","مِّثْلَ","صَٰعِقَةِ","عَادٍ","وَثَمُودَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-46-21-4","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenuo je","en":"he/it warned"},{"bs":"i opominju vas","en":"and they warn you (all)"},{"bs":"pa opomeni!","en":"so warn!"},{"bs":"opomenuo ih je","en":"he/it warned them"}],"ref":"46:21","answerWord":"أَنذَرَ","answerSound":"audio/e2590f8de751373e6144.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And make mention (O Muhammad) of the brother of A'ad when he warned his folk among the wind-curved sandhills - and verily warners came and went before and after him - saying: Serve none but Allah. Lo! I fear for you the doom of a tremendous Day.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَٱذْكُرْ","أَخَا","عَادٍ","إِذْ","أَنذَرَ","قَوْمَهُۥ","بِٱلْأَحْقَافِ","وَقَدْ","خَلَتِ","ٱلنُّذُرُ","مِنۢ","بَيْنِ","يَدَيْهِ","وَمِنْ","خَلْفِهِۦٓ","أَلَّا","تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهَ","إِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","عَذَابَ","يَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-54-36-1","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomenuo ih je","en":"he/it warned them"},{"bs":"bivaju opomenuti","en":"they are warned"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"opomeni!","en":"warn!"}],"ref":"54:36","answerWord":"أَنذَرَهُم","answerSound":"audio/39c2b11ca651646fa1f7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And he indeed had warned them of Our blow, but they did doubt the warnings.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","أَنذَرَهُم","بَطْشَتَنَا","فَتَمَارَوْا۟","بِٱلنُّذُرِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"andhara-71-1-6","words":["verb:andhara"],"options":[{"bs":"opomeni!","en":"warn!"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and warn them!"},{"bs":"i da bivaju opomenuti","en":"and so that they may be warned"},{"bs":"opomenite!","en":"(you all) warn!"}],"ref":"71:1","answerWord":"أَنذِرْ","answerSound":"audio/85fe6f97c2859541fc67.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We sent Noah unto his people (saying): Warn thy people ere the painful doom come unto them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, upozoriti","en":"to warn"},"passage":["إِنَّآ","أَرْسَلْنَا","نُوحًا","إِلَىٰ","قَوْمِهِۦٓ","أَنْ","أَنذِرْ","قَوْمَكَ","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِيَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","أَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَنذَرَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-26-157-1","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su postali","en":"so they became"},{"bs":"sigurno će postati","en":"they will surely become"},{"bs":"pa postajete","en":"so you (all) become"},{"bs":"pa ste postali","en":"so you (all) became"}],"ref":"26:157","answerWord":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/539b88a340049b4daef9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But they hamstrung her, and then were penitent.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["فَعَقَرُوهَا","فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","نَٰدِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-41-23-6","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ste postali","en":"so you (all) became"},{"bs":"i postao je","en":"and he/it became"},{"bs":"sigurno će postati","en":"they will surely become"},{"bs":"pa su postali","en":"so they became"}],"ref":"41:23","answerWord":"فَأَصْبَحْتُم","answerSound":"audio/fb912813df40f72b11d9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That, your thought which ye did think about your Lord, hath ruined you; and ye find yourselves (this day) among the lost.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["وَذَٰلِكُمْ","ظَنُّكُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","ظَنَنتُم","بِرَبِّكُمْ","أَرْدَىٰكُمْ","فَأَصْبَحْتُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-28-10-0","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"i postao je","en":"and he/it became"},{"bs":"pa postaju","en":"so they become"},{"bs":"pa postajete","en":"so you (all) become"},{"bs":"postali su","en":"they became"}],"ref":"28:10","answerWord":"وَأَصْبَحَ","answerSound":"audio/8ba90b4e53274eeb5bac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the heart of the mother of Moses became void, and she would have betrayed him if We had not fortified her heart, that she might be of the believers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["وَأَصْبَحَ","فُؤَادُ","أُمِّ","مُوسَىٰ","فَٰرِغًا","إِن","كَادَتْ","لَتُبْدِى","بِهِۦ","لَوْلَآ","أَن","رَّبَطْنَا","عَلَىٰ","قَلْبِهَا","لِتَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-5-52-21","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa postaju","en":"so they become"},{"bs":"postali su","en":"they became"},{"bs":"postao je","en":"he/it became"},{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"}],"ref":"5:52","answerWord":"فَيُصْبِحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/db5ff37444c13d466056.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And thou seest those in whose heart is a disease race toward them, saying: We fear lest a change of fortune befall us. And it may happen that Allah will vouchsafe (unto thee) the victory, or a commandment from His presence. Then will they repent them of their secret thoughts.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["فَتَرَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","فِى","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّرَضٌ","يُسَٰرِعُونَ","فِيهِمْ","يَقُولُونَ","نَخْشَىٰٓ","أَن","تُصِيبَنَا","دَآئِرَةٌ","فَعَسَى","ٱللَّهُ","أَن","يَأْتِىَ","بِٱلْفَتْحِ","أَوْ","أَمْرٍ","مِّنْ","عِندِهِۦ","فَيُصْبِحُوا۟","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","أَسَرُّوا۟","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","نَٰدِمِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-5-102-6","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"postali su","en":"they became"},{"bs":"sigurno će postati","en":"they will surely become"},{"bs":"pa ste postali","en":"so you (all) became"},{"bs":"i postao je","en":"and he/it became"}],"ref":"5:102","answerWord":"أَصْبَحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/15eb235820b094d37db1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A folk before you asked (for such disclosures) and then disbelieved therein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["قَدْ","سَأَلَهَا","قَوْمٌ","مِّن","قَبْلِكُمْ","ثُمَّ","أَصْبَحُوا۟","بِهَا","كَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-18-41-1","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"},{"bs":"pa postaju","en":"so they become"},{"bs":"postao je","en":"he/it became"},{"bs":"postali su","en":"they became"}],"ref":"18:41","answerWord":"يُصْبِحَ","answerSound":"audio/29911e12a200c68b9da8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or some morning the water thereof will be lost in the earth so that thou canst not make search for it.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["أَوْ","يُصْبِحَ","مَآؤُهَا","غَوْرًا","فَلَن","تَسْتَطِيعَ","لَهُۥ","طَلَبًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-23-40-3","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"sigurno će postati","en":"they will surely become"},{"bs":"pa ste postali","en":"so you (all) became"},{"bs":"osvanjujete","en":"you (all) enter the morning"},{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"}],"ref":"23:40","answerWord":"لَّيُصْبِحُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/122f011a6aa909a10a39.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: In a little while they surely will become repentant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["قَالَ","عَمَّا","قَلِيلٍ","لَّيُصْبِحُنَّ","نَٰدِمِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-30-17-5","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"osvanjujete","en":"you (all) enter the morning"},{"bs":"i postao je","en":"and he/it became"},{"bs":"pa su postali","en":"so they became"},{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"}],"ref":"30:17","answerWord":"تُصْبِحُونَ","answerSound":"audio/5bd0ae8e8328a59093f2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So glory be to Allah when ye enter the night and when ye enter the morning -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["فَسُبْحَٰنَ","ٱللَّهِ","حِينَ","تُمْسُونَ","وَحِينَ","تُصْبِحُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-49-6-12","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"pa postajete","en":"so you (all) become"},{"bs":"postali su","en":"they became"},{"bs":"postao je","en":"he/it became"},{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"}],"ref":"49:6","answerWord":"فَتُصْبِحُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/28609965623ff2fa9b81.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! If an evil-liver bring you tidings, verify it, lest ye smite some folk in ignorance and afterward repent of what ye did.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِن","جَآءَكُمْ","فَاسِقٌۢ","بِنَبَإٍ","فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟","أَن","تُصِيبُوا۟","قَوْمًۢا","بِجَهَٰلَةٍ","فَتُصْبِحُوا۟","عَلَىٰ","مَا","فَعَلْتُمْ","نَٰدِمِينَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"asbaha-67-30-3","words":["verb:asbaha"],"options":[{"bs":"postao je","en":"he/it became"},{"bs":"pa postajete","en":"so you (all) become"},{"bs":"pa ste postali","en":"so you (all) became"},{"bs":"postaje","en":"he/it becomes"}],"ref":"67:30","answerWord":"أَصْبَحَ","answerSound":"audio/1757e7aaff2bde6b2a3c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Have ye thought: If (all) your water were to disappear into the earth, who then could bring you gushing water?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"postati, osvanuti","en":"to become, to be in the morning"},"passage":["قُلْ","أَرَءَيْتُمْ","إِنْ","أَصْبَحَ","مَآؤُكُمْ","غَوْرًا","فَمَن","يَأْتِيكُم","بِمَآءٍ","مَّعِينٍۭ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَصْبَحَ"}},{"id":"darra-3-176-8","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štete","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti im","en":"he/it harms them"},{"bs":"šteti ti","en":"he/it harms you"}],"ref":"3:176","answerWord":"يَضُرُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/c29f2984160c6916a46c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Let not their conduct grieve thee, who run easily to disbelief, for lo! they injure Allah not at all. It is Allah's Will to assign them no portion in the Hereafter, and theirs will be an awful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["وَلَا","يَحْزُنكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يُسَٰرِعُونَ","فِى","ٱلْكُفْرِ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَن","يَضُرُّوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","شَيْـًٔا","يُرِيدُ","ٱللَّهُ","أَلَّا","يَجْعَلَ","لَهُمْ","حَظًّا","فِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-21-66-10","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"šteti vam","en":"he/it harms you (all)"},{"bs":"štete","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti nam","en":"he/it harms us"}],"ref":"21:66","answerWord":"يَضُرُّكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/7c0dcf14a6776cf1cb3f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Worship ye then instead of Allah that which cannot profit you at all, nor harm you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["قَالَ","أَفَتَعْبُدُونَ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","يَنفَعُكُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","وَلَا","يَضُرُّكُمْ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-3-111-1","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štete vam","en":"they harm you (all)"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti vam","en":"he/it harms you (all)"},{"bs":"šteti nam","en":"he/it harms us"}],"ref":"3:111","answerWord":"يَضُرُّوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/91dfcd31781b8119497d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will not harm you save a trifling hurt, and if they fight against you they will turn and flee. And afterward they will not be helped.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["لَن","يَضُرُّوكُمْ","إِلَّآ","أَذًى","وَإِن","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","يُوَلُّوكُمُ","ٱلْأَدْبَارَ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يُنصَرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-3-144-21","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"šteti","en":"he/it harms"},{"bs":"šteti ti","en":"he/it harms you"},{"bs":"šteti im","en":"he/it harms them"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"}],"ref":"3:144","answerWord":"يَضُرَّ","answerSound":"audio/4980f9db7527ad3e455e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Muhammad is but a messenger, messengers (the like of whom) have passed away before him. Will it be that, when he dieth or is slain, ye will turn back on your heels? He who turneth back on his heels doth no hurt to Allah, and Allah will reward the thankful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["وَمَا","مُحَمَّدٌ","إِلَّا","رَسُولٌ","قَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِهِ","ٱلرُّسُلُ","أَفَإِي۟ن","مَّاتَ","أَوْ","قُتِلَ","ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَعْقَٰبِكُمْ","وَمَن","يَنقَلِبْ","عَلَىٰ","عَقِبَيْهِ","فَلَن","يَضُرَّ","ٱللَّهَ","شَيْـًٔا","وَسَيَجْزِى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلشَّٰكِرِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-5-42-15","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štete ti","en":"they harm you"},{"bs":"štete vam","en":"they harm you (all)"},{"bs":"štete","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"šteti","en":"he/it harms"}],"ref":"5:42","answerWord":"يَضُرُّوكَ","answerSound":"audio/9dd7632abb91a5e3d63c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Listeners for the sake of falsehood! Greedy for illicit gain! If then they have recourse unto thee (Muhammad) judge between them or disclaim jurisdiction. If thou disclaimest jurisdiction, then they cannot harm thee at all. But if thou judgest, judge between them with equity. Lo! Allah loveth the equitable.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["سَمَّٰعُونَ","لِلْكَذِبِ","أَكَّٰلُونَ","لِلسُّحْتِ","فَإِن","جَآءُوكَ","فَٱحْكُم","بَيْنَهُمْ","أَوْ","أَعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","وَإِن","تُعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","فَلَن","يَضُرُّوكَ","شَيْـًٔا","وَإِنْ","حَكَمْتَ","فَٱحْكُم","بَيْنَهُم","بِٱلْقِسْطِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُقْسِطِينَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-5-105-6","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"šteti vam","en":"he/it harms you (all)"},{"bs":"štete vam","en":"they harm you (all)"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"štete ti","en":"they harm you"}],"ref":"5:105","answerWord":"يَضُرُّكُم","answerSound":"audio/c3385e6e2b50c0098d39.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Ye have charge of your own souls. He who erreth cannot injure you if ye are rightly guided. Unto Allah ye will all return; and then He will inform you of what ye used to do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","عَلَيْكُمْ","أَنفُسَكُمْ","لَا","يَضُرُّكُم","مَّن","ضَلَّ","إِذَا","ٱهْتَدَيْتُمْ","إِلَى","ٱللَّهِ","مَرْجِعُكُمْ","جَمِيعًا","فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-9-39-9","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti mu","en":"he/it harms him"},{"bs":"šteti vam","en":"he/it harms you (all)"},{"bs":"šteti nam","en":"he/it harms us"}],"ref":"9:39","answerWord":"تَضُرُّوهُ","answerSound":"audio/07fe7f864eda17692481.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If ye go not forth He will afflict you with a painful doom, and will choose instead of you a folk other than you. Ye cannot harm Him at all. Allah is Able to do all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["إِلَّا","تَنفِرُوا۟","يُعَذِّبْكُمْ","عَذَابًا","أَلِيمًا","وَيَسْتَبْدِلْ","قَوْمًا","غَيْرَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَضُرُّوهُ","شَيْـًٔا","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","قَدِيرٌ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-10-106-9","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"šteti ti","en":"he/it harms you"},{"bs":"štete","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"štete ti","en":"they harm you"},{"bs":"šteti im","en":"he/it harms them"}],"ref":"10:106","answerWord":"يَضُرُّكَ","answerSound":"audio/ebcfbefefa37a1e36fae.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And cry not, beside Allah, unto that which cannot profit thee nor hurt thee, for if thou didst so then wert thou of the wrong-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["وَلَا","تَدْعُ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","يَنفَعُكَ","وَلَا","يَضُرُّكَ","فَإِن","فَعَلْتَ","فَإِنَّكَ","إِذًا","مِّنَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-11-57-13","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti vam","en":"he/it harms you (all)"},{"bs":"štete ti","en":"they harm you"},{"bs":"šteti nam","en":"he/it harms us"}],"ref":"11:57","answerWord":"تَضُرُّونَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/6bbcc3dd4a9199ae5812.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if ye turn away, still I have conveyed unto you that wherewith I was sent unto you, and my Lord will set in place of you a folk other than you. Ye cannot injure Him at all. Lo! my Lord is Guardian over all things.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["فَإِن","تَوَلَّوْا۟","فَقَدْ","أَبْلَغْتُكُم","مَّآ","أُرْسِلْتُ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَيْكُمْ","وَيَسْتَخْلِفُ","رَبِّى","قَوْمًا","غَيْرَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَضُرُّونَهُۥ","شَيْـًٔا","إِنَّ","رَبِّى","عَلَىٰ","كُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","حَفِيظٌ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-22-12-6","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"šteti mu","en":"he/it harms him"},{"bs":"štetite mu","en":"you (all) harm him"},{"bs":"šteti","en":"he/it harms"},{"bs":"štete ti","en":"they harm you"}],"ref":"22:12","answerWord":"يَضُرُّهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/1abcfda9fa79d6388a1d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He calleth, beside Allah, unto that which hurteth him not nor benefiteth him. That is the far error.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["يَدْعُوا۟","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَا","يَضُرُّهُۥ","وَمَا","لَا","يَنفَعُهُۥ","ذَٰلِكَ","هُوَ","ٱلضَّلَٰلُ","ٱلْبَعِيدُ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"darra-26-73-3","words":["verb:darra"],"options":[{"bs":"štete","en":"they harm"},{"bs":"šteti","en":"he/it harms"},{"bs":"šteti nam","en":"he/it harms us"},{"bs":"šteti ti","en":"he/it harms you"}],"ref":"26:73","answerWord":"يَضُرُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/690ebdfd1491346aaf1e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or do they benefit or harm you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nauditi, štetiti","en":"to harm"},"passage":["أَوْ","يَنفَعُونَكُمْ","أَوْ","يَضُرُّونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"ضَرَّ"}},{"id":"qaraa-96-3-0","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"čitaj","en":"read"},{"bs":"čitaju","en":"they read"},{"bs":"učimo ga","en":"We have recited it"},{"bs":"pročitan je","en":"he/it was read"}],"ref":"96:3","answerWord":"ٱقْرَأْ","answerSound":"audio/b08220e8de30bf45c3c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Read: And thy Lord is the Most Bounteous,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["ٱقْرَأْ","وَرَبُّكَ","ٱلْأَكْرَمُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-7-204-1","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"pročitan je","en":"he/it was read"},{"bs":"čitamo je","en":"we read it"},{"bs":"čitaj","en":"read"},{"bs":"čitaju","en":"they read"}],"ref":"7:204","answerWord":"قُرِئَ","answerSound":"audio/60a7002a714585b2c2d5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the Qur'an is recited, give ear to it and pay heed, that ye may obtain mercy.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قُرِئَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","فَٱسْتَمِعُوا۟","لَهُۥ","وَأَنصِتُوا۟","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُرْحَمُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-10-94-9","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"čitaju","en":"they read"},{"bs":"čitao si","en":"you read"},{"bs":"čitamo je","en":"we read it"},{"bs":"pa čitajte!","en":"so (you all) read!"}],"ref":"10:94","answerWord":"يَقْرَءُونَ","answerSound":"audio/53dc97fb2cc3ac0f545e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if thou (Muhammad) art in doubt concerning that which We reveal unto thee, then question those who read the Scripture (that was) before thee. Verily the Truth from thy Lord hath come unto thee. So be not thou of the waverers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["فَإِن","كُنتَ","فِى","شَكٍّ","مِّمَّآ","أَنزَلْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","فَسْـَٔلِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَقْرَءُونَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","مِن","قَبْلِكَ","لَقَدْ","جَآءَكَ","ٱلْحَقُّ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","فَلَا","تَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-16-98-1","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"čitao si","en":"you read"},{"bs":"čitamo je","en":"we read it"},{"bs":"pa čitajte!","en":"so (you all) read!"},{"bs":"čitaju","en":"they read"}],"ref":"16:98","answerWord":"قَرَأْتَ","answerSound":"audio/1a81c563ff9a8d7ae47f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when thou recitest the Qur'an, seek refuge in Allah from Satan the outcast.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","قَرَأْتَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","فَٱسْتَعِذْ","بِٱللَّهِ","مِنَ","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنِ","ٱلرَّجِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-17-93-17","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"čitamo je","en":"we read it"},{"bs":"pročitan je","en":"he/it was read"},{"bs":"pa čitajte!","en":"so (you all) read!"},{"bs":"pa ga je čitao","en":"so he/it read it"}],"ref":"17:93","answerWord":"نَّقْرَؤُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/c7ebd646a491e9ebd411.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or thou have a house of gold; or thou ascend up into heaven, and even then we will put no faith in thine ascension till thou bring down for us a book that we can read. Say (O Muhammad): My Lord be Glorified! Am I aught save a mortal messenger?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["أَوْ","يَكُونَ","لَكَ","بَيْتٌ","مِّن","زُخْرُفٍ","أَوْ","تَرْقَىٰ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَلَن","نُّؤْمِنَ","لِرُقِيِّكَ","حَتَّىٰ","تُنَزِّلَ","عَلَيْنَا","كِتَٰبًا","نَّقْرَؤُهُۥ","قُلْ","سُبْحَانَ","رَبِّى","هَلْ","كُنتُ","إِلَّا","بَشَرًا","رَّسُولًا"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-26-199-0","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je čitao","en":"so he/it read it"},{"bs":"čitaj","en":"read"},{"bs":"pročitan je","en":"he/it was read"},{"bs":"čitao si","en":"you read"}],"ref":"26:199","answerWord":"فَقَرَأَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/ecb777e4482c59e1d425.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And he had read it unto them, they would not have believed in it.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["فَقَرَأَهُۥ","عَلَيْهِم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","بِهِۦ","مُؤْمِنِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-69-19-7","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"čitajte!","en":"(you all) read!"},{"bs":"čitamo je","en":"we read it"},{"bs":"pa ga je čitao","en":"so he/it read it"},{"bs":"čitaju","en":"they read"}],"ref":"69:19","answerWord":"ٱقْرَءُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/25b977ad1e937434f698.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, as for him who is given his record in his right hand, he will say: Take, read my book!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["فَأَمَّا","مَنْ","أُوتِىَ","كِتَٰبَهُۥ","بِيَمِينِهِۦ","فَيَقُولُ","هَآؤُمُ","ٱقْرَءُوا۟","كِتَٰبِيَهْ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"qaraa-75-18-1","words":["verb:qaraa"],"options":[{"bs":"učimo ga","en":"We have recited it"},{"bs":"pa ga je čitao","en":"so he/it read it"},{"bs":"čitaj","en":"read"},{"bs":"pročitan je","en":"he/it was read"}],"ref":"75:18","answerWord":"قَرَأْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/fb9b56208a9cb0c1b861.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We read it, follow thou the reading;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"čitati, učiti","en":"to read, to recite"},"passage":["فَإِذَا","قَرَأْنَٰهُ","فَٱتَّبِعْ","قُرْءَانَهُۥ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"قَرَأَ"}},{"id":"athara-12-91-3","words":["verb:athara"],"options":[{"bs":"dao ti je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you"},{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and (he) preferred"},{"bs":"dajemo ti prednost","en":"we prefer you"},{"bs":"i daju prednost","en":"and they prefer"}],"ref":"12:91","answerWord":"ءَاثَرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/02705ed858ae050de345.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: By Allah, verily Allah hath preferred thee above us, and we were indeed sinful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prednost, pretpostaviti","en":"to prefer"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","تَٱللَّهِ","لَقَدْ","ءَاثَرَكَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْنَا","وَإِن","كُنَّا","لَخَٰطِـِٔينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"آثَرَ"}},{"id":"athara-20-72-2","words":["verb:athara"],"options":[{"bs":"dajemo ti prednost","en":"we prefer you"},{"bs":"dao ti je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you"},{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and (he) preferred"},{"bs":"i daju prednost","en":"and they prefer"}],"ref":"20:72","answerWord":"نُّؤْثِرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/b2b5ee513fbd6cda4f80.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: We choose thee not above the clear proofs that have come unto us, and above Him Who created us. So decree what thou wilt decree. Thou wilt end for us only this life of the world.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prednost, pretpostaviti","en":"to prefer"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","لَن","نُّؤْثِرَكَ","عَلَىٰ","مَا","جَآءَنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْبَيِّنَٰتِ","وَٱلَّذِى","فَطَرَنَا","فَٱقْضِ","مَآ","أَنتَ","قَاضٍ","إِنَّمَا","تَقْضِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَآ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"آثَرَ"}},{"id":"athara-79-38-0","words":["verb:athara"],"options":[{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and (he) preferred"},{"bs":"dajemo ti prednost","en":"we prefer you"},{"bs":"dao ti je prednost","en":"he/it preferred you"},{"bs":"vi dajete prednost","en":"you (all) prefer"}],"ref":"79:38","answerWord":"وَءَاثَرَ","answerSound":"audio/2e920058b5456abfcfef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And chose the life of the world,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prednost, pretpostaviti","en":"to prefer"},"passage":["وَءَاثَرَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"آثَرَ"}},{"id":"athara-87-16-1","words":["verb:athara"],"options":[{"bs":"vi dajete prednost","en":"you (all) prefer"},{"bs":"i daju prednost","en":"and they prefer"},{"bs":"i dao je prednost","en":"and (he) preferred"},{"bs":"dajemo ti prednost","en":"we prefer you"}],"ref":"87:16","answerWord":"تُؤْثِرُونَ","answerSound":"audio/3fcff8c3f2255c59d433.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But ye prefer the life of the world","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prednost, pretpostaviti","en":"to prefer"},"passage":["بَلْ","تُؤْثِرُونَ","ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","ٱلدُّنْيَا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"آثَرَ"}}]